### ===================================================================
### Cocos Capital - Backend Challenge API (REST Client)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@userId = 1

### 1. Health & Actuator Metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Portfolio Endpoints
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Get User Portfolio (Query Parameter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolio?userId={{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Get User Portfolio (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/portfolio/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Instruments Search Endpoints
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Search by Ticker (e.g. GGAL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=GGAL&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Search by Name (e.g. Galicia)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=Galicia&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 3.3 List All Instruments (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?page=0&size=20&sort=ticker,asc
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Orders Endpoints
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Enviar Orden MARKET BUY por Cantidad Exacta (Size)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "ticker": "GGAL",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 10
}

### 4.2 Enviar Orden LIMIT BUY por Cantidad Exacta (Size)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "ticker": "GGAL",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "price": 850.00,
  "size": 5
}

### 4.3 Enviar Orden por Monto de Inversión en Pesos (Amount)
### Calcula la cantidad de acciones máximas sin fracciones
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "ticker": "GGAL",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amount": 10000.00
}

### 4.4 Enviar Orden con Saldo Insuficiente (Genera REJECTED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "ticker": "GGAL",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 1000000
}

### 4.5 Cancelar una Orden en Estado NEW
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/5/cancel
Accept: application/json

### 4.6 Intentar Cancelar una Orden FILLED (Retorna 422 Problem Detail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/1/cancel
Accept: application/json
